Package: ShuttleboxR
Title: Data Exploration and Analysis for Shuttle-Box Temperature Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9003
Authors@R: 
    person("Pieter", "Riesenkamp", , "p.b.riesenkamp@student.rug.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a streamlined workflow for importing, organising,
    inspecting, analysing, and visualising data from ShuttleSoft shuttle-box
    temperature experiments. Functions calculate thermal preference, avoidance
    temperatures, effective selected thermal breadth, movement, chamber
    occupancy, shuttling behaviour, and project-level summaries.
